# sqlfluff's dbt templater compiles the project with cwd = project_dir, which
# resolves profiles.yml's `path: warehouse.duckdb` relative to transform/
# instead of the repo root -- so `sqlfluff lint` / `make lint` leaves a stray,
# empty duplicate warehouse file here. The real, committed warehouse lives at
# the repo root.
transform/warehouse.duckdb
